WEBVTT

00:00:01.114 --> 00:00:12.992
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.126 --> 00:00:18.699
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.699 --> 00:00:25.628
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.139 --> 00:00:37.175
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.351 --> 00:00:43.290
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:50.696
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:58.505
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.505 --> 00:01:05.379
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:10.984
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:10.984 --> 00:01:17.257
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.257 --> 00:01:25.687
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:32.038 --> 00:01:34.905
Flo! Flo!

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.769
Flo!

00:01:40.414 --> 00:01:42.405
Flo!

00:01:44.117 --> 00:01:47.245
-It's Father!
-Flo!

00:01:47.754 --> 00:01:49.381
Flo!

00:01:49.623 --> 00:01:52.751
Father... He's so worn out.

00:01:54.361 --> 00:01:56.352
Flo!

00:01:56.963 --> 00:02:01.900
ORSEL

00:02:08.175 --> 00:02:10.803
It's Flo! There's no mistake!

00:02:12.879 --> 00:02:16.212
-Which way?!
-Wait! Please wait!

00:02:17.717 --> 00:02:20.151
Blast it! We lost her!

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.711
Was it really Flo?

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.554
I've been searching for her for 6 years!

00:02:29.629 --> 00:02:31.529
That was Flo!

00:02:41.641 --> 00:02:43.336
Soreto.

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.401
What if someone had seen you?

00:02:47.447 --> 00:02:49.176
That's right.

00:02:49.616 --> 00:02:51.885
I know that!

00:02:51.885 --> 00:02:55.377
Nobody saw anything! I made sure of it!

00:02:59.893 --> 00:03:01.884
I found her.

00:03:05.165 --> 00:03:07.395
You found her? It can't be!

00:03:07.534 --> 00:03:09.559
A girl who draws pictures just like this one

00:03:09.603 --> 00:03:11.938
is said to be living in Kremer
on the Eastern Mainland.

00:03:11.938 --> 00:03:13.540
What did you say?!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.943
A girl named Helga. She's the
same age we are, 11 years old.

00:03:18.879 --> 00:03:21.905
I just wish I could have seen
one of the pictures she draws.

00:03:22.215 --> 00:03:24.084
11 years old.

00:03:24.084 --> 00:03:25.919
It must be her, Aghi!

00:03:25.919 --> 00:03:28.855
Tina is the only one who
would draw this scene!

00:03:28.855 --> 00:03:31.925
This is great! Now we can go home!

00:03:31.925 --> 00:03:35.195
Wait, Hesma.
It hasn't been confirmed yet.

00:03:35.195 --> 00:03:38.596
Yes, but it's a very strong possibility.

00:03:38.832 --> 00:03:40.527
Let's go, Aghi!

00:03:42.669 --> 00:03:45.763
What's the matter, Soreto?
Did something happen?

00:03:48.842 --> 00:03:50.537
This means...

00:03:54.648 --> 00:03:58.243
This means we don't have
to suffer anymore, right?

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.051
Soreto...

00:04:31.618 --> 00:04:33.253
That light...

00:04:33.253 --> 00:04:36.056
Aghi! Those blue emissions just now!

00:04:36.056 --> 00:04:37.724
Something's wrong.

00:04:37.724 --> 00:04:39.521
It was just like it.

00:04:43.763 --> 00:04:45.865
What are you talking about?

00:04:45.865 --> 00:04:48.561
-That's impossible!
-Aghi!

00:04:50.203 --> 00:04:52.763
-What was that?
-I don't know.

00:05:02.682 --> 00:05:05.752
State... Police Officer?

00:05:05.752 --> 00:05:09.689
Please excuse me! Thank you for
coming all the way from the main office!

00:05:09.689 --> 00:05:12.852
This is terrible... What happened?

00:05:13.159 --> 00:05:14.861
An assailant broke into the house,

00:05:14.861 --> 00:05:16.863
kidnapped a young girl, and ran away.

00:05:16.863 --> 00:05:20.033
The girl is actually a blind niece taken in

00:05:20.033 --> 00:05:22.501
when she lost her family a few years ago.

00:05:22.569 --> 00:05:25.538
The dead person is the niece's fiancé.

00:05:25.538 --> 00:05:28.234
Did the culprit use a bomb or something?

00:06:13.386 --> 00:06:15.922
There's no evidence of explosives,

00:06:15.922 --> 00:06:17.913
but the roof was blown off.

00:06:18.758 --> 00:06:21.420
It's as if it had been struck by lightning.

00:06:21.661 --> 00:06:23.822
It's a strange story.

00:06:24.564 --> 00:06:26.766
This is Oro from Gaisha.

00:06:26.766 --> 00:06:28.757
He was 26 years old.

00:06:29.069 --> 00:06:31.765
What could have done this to him?

00:06:46.352 --> 00:06:50.186
There's no way an ordinary human
being could do something like this.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.358
So, where's the culprit?

00:06:52.358 --> 00:06:55.161
Right! Kirchner took the girl as a hostage

00:06:55.161 --> 00:06:58.130
and is holed up in a cottage
in that forest over there.

00:06:58.198 --> 00:07:00.734
-Kirchner?
-Is that the culprit's name?

00:07:00.734 --> 00:07:03.567
Yes, that's the name he gave.

00:07:04.771 --> 00:07:09.834
However, if it really was Kirchner,
he should be 27 years old.

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:13.406
But from the looks of him
he had to be over seventy.

00:07:16.349 --> 00:07:17.784
Seventy?

00:07:17.784 --> 00:07:18.952
Yes.

00:07:18.952 --> 00:07:22.615
More importantly, Kirchner died
in an accident three years ago.

00:07:23.022 --> 00:07:24.956
During a military flight test.

00:07:29.095 --> 00:07:30.764
It's happening again.

00:07:30.764 --> 00:07:32.766
That man named Grass in Nohedge,

00:07:32.766 --> 00:07:35.135
and the commotion over a
capture on Chikao Island.

00:07:35.135 --> 00:07:37.569
They were all old people
over the age of seventy.

00:07:38.338 --> 00:07:40.806
Wait a minute, Detective Cooks!

00:07:41.007 --> 00:07:44.636
Geez! He gets involved in everything!

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.713
Big Brother... Big Brother, is it you?

00:07:57.323 --> 00:07:59.993
Yes. It's me, Cybele.

00:07:59.993 --> 00:08:02.462
Though I've changed a great deal...

00:08:02.462 --> 00:08:04.731
It's your big brother.
You can tell, can't you?

00:08:04.731 --> 00:08:07.267
It really is you, Big Brother!

00:08:07.267 --> 00:08:09.369
I always believed...

00:08:09.369 --> 00:08:13.273
that you were still alive, that you
would definitely come home!

00:08:13.273 --> 00:08:17.869
There was a terrible
accident. They tricked me.

00:08:17.911 --> 00:08:19.846
But that doesn't matter.

00:08:19.846 --> 00:08:23.247
I was worried about you,
so I escaped and came back.

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:26.386
I promised to come home right away,

00:08:26.386 --> 00:08:30.990
instead I made you feel
lonely. Do you hate me for it?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:34.187
No. How could I hate you?

00:08:36.062 --> 00:08:39.031
Were your aunt and uncle cruel to you?

00:08:40.433 --> 00:08:43.402
They took you in for the
money it got them.

00:08:43.937 --> 00:08:47.395
The money the military paid
me just went straight to them.

00:08:47.907 --> 00:08:51.172
But they didn't care about
you at all, did they?

00:08:54.614 --> 00:08:56.549
I knew it.

00:08:56.549 --> 00:08:59.950
On top of that they let that scum
come around asking for your hand.

00:09:00.286 --> 00:09:02.622
Big Brother, where is he?

00:09:02.622 --> 00:09:04.385
Oro?

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:06.583
He's dead.

00:09:07.193 --> 00:09:09.128
Did you kill him?

00:09:09.128 --> 00:09:11.531
Yes! He was scum!

00:09:11.531 --> 00:09:14.100
He took advantage of
you because you're blind.

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:16.534
He's always been like that.

00:09:16.803 --> 00:09:19.795
He promised them money
and tried to take you!

00:09:19.973 --> 00:09:21.668
That's true.

00:09:25.144 --> 00:09:28.375
Something is wrong with my body.

00:09:28.982 --> 00:09:31.746
Alright, Cybele, listen to me carefully...

00:09:31.885 --> 00:09:36.288
I promised that I'd stay by your
side and protect you always.

00:09:37.423 --> 00:09:39.893
But I can't do that anymore.

00:09:39.893 --> 00:09:42.521
I don't think I have much longer to live!

00:09:45.965 --> 00:09:49.102
Don't... Big Brother,
don't say things like that!

00:09:49.102 --> 00:09:50.933
Please!

00:09:52.005 --> 00:09:54.941
I couldn't stand to be
parted from you like that.

00:09:54.941 --> 00:09:58.138
I had to come and see you
no matter what.

00:09:58.244 --> 00:10:00.780
You'll forgive me, won't you?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:04.341
I can't... keep my promise.

00:10:05.151 --> 00:10:08.279
I'm sorry... Cybele.

00:10:16.095 --> 00:10:18.063
Big Brother...

00:10:42.322 --> 00:10:44.390
They say the old man holed up in there

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:47.627
released a powerful electrical
charge and killed one person.

00:10:47.627 --> 00:10:49.662
He's a pilot named Kirchner,

00:10:49.662 --> 00:10:52.756
and he's holding his
own little sister hostage.

00:10:52.899 --> 00:10:54.764
His little sister?

00:11:06.946 --> 00:11:08.915
Th-This response I'm getting...

00:11:08.915 --> 00:11:11.315
I-It's Orsel!

00:11:12.652 --> 00:11:14.420
What did you say?!

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:17.423
It's just a small amount
but it's definitely Orsel.

00:11:17.423 --> 00:11:19.726
There's a residue of it
somewhere in this area!

00:11:19.726 --> 00:11:22.962
-How can that be?!
-There can't be any Orsel here!

00:11:22.962 --> 00:11:24.953
There must be some mistake!!

00:11:25.064 --> 00:11:26.966
The waveform of Orsel.

00:11:26.966 --> 00:11:30.269
Orsel doesn't exist anywhere in nature,

00:11:30.269 --> 00:11:32.372
only in the Zone.

00:11:32.372 --> 00:11:34.440
It can't be! Let's check it out!

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.576
Wait! Wait, Aghi!

00:11:36.576 --> 00:11:38.778
We've finally found
that girl named Helga!

00:11:38.778 --> 00:11:40.913
There's no point in getting involved
with these people right now!

00:11:40.913 --> 00:11:42.175
Aghi!

00:11:43.282 --> 00:11:44.984
Hey, look at that.

00:11:44.984 --> 00:11:47.220
There's an odd group of people here.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.322
They're certainly not the Clairmont police.

00:11:49.322 --> 00:11:51.557
Ah! That woman!

00:11:51.557 --> 00:11:53.393
Gherta Hawksbee?

00:11:53.393 --> 00:11:55.395
She's the director of Phantom Ged, right?

00:11:55.395 --> 00:11:57.230
Why is she in a place like this?

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:01.167
The capture on Chikao, and
the taking of Grass's body...

00:12:01.167 --> 00:12:03.336
This group must be responsible.

00:12:03.336 --> 00:12:05.327
So, what do we do?

00:12:08.808 --> 00:12:11.711
Director, we can get in at any time.

00:12:11.711 --> 00:12:14.680
I want Kirchner taken
in alive and unharmed.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:18.151
Apparently he has a hostage as
well, so be extremely careful.

00:12:18.151 --> 00:12:19.778
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:23.356 --> 00:12:25.658
I have you with me.

00:12:25.658 --> 00:12:28.752
My big brother who's
always thinking of me.

00:12:28.928 --> 00:12:31.021
So I'm completely fine.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:34.731
No matter what happens,
I won't be sad.

00:12:35.668 --> 00:12:37.363
Cybele...

00:12:42.842 --> 00:12:44.742
Who are you?!

00:13:05.364 --> 00:13:08.601
Wh-Who are you people?!

00:13:08.601 --> 00:13:11.764
Big Brother? What's the
matter, Big Brother?

00:13:12.538 --> 00:13:14.740
It's okay, nothing's the matter.

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:17.300
Don't worry, Cybele.

00:13:20.713 --> 00:13:24.649
The light coming from your
body is not ordinary electricity!

00:13:26.419 --> 00:13:29.822
Orsel. It's the light you're emitting.

00:13:29.822 --> 00:13:33.159
I don't know! I don't understand this!

00:13:33.159 --> 00:13:36.026
What did you do?!
What was done to you?!

00:13:39.065 --> 00:13:41.192
Did you open the Zone?

00:13:43.803 --> 00:13:46.966
The Zone? What are you talking about?

00:13:47.206 --> 00:13:50.767
Our mission was to test
an aviation machine.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:54.912
I just did what the people from
the organization told me to do.

00:13:55.414 --> 00:13:58.417
Look at this, look at my body.

00:13:58.417 --> 00:14:01.250
And I'm only twenty-seven!

00:14:17.136 --> 00:14:20.367
Father... Mother...

00:14:25.244 --> 00:14:28.475
Big Brother, what's the
matter? What happened?!

00:14:28.915 --> 00:14:30.883
It's Enma!

00:14:32.218 --> 00:14:33.845
You...

00:14:36.122 --> 00:14:38.352
You've been taken over
by Enma, haven't you?

00:14:39.192 --> 00:14:41.861
Listen! You can't stay here!

00:14:41.861 --> 00:14:44.130
You're coming with us! If this continues,

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:46.165
your sister will get dragged into it!

00:14:46.165 --> 00:14:47.894
Leave me alone!

00:14:48.367 --> 00:14:51.530
I can't leave Cybele alone.

00:14:51.971 --> 00:14:55.841
I came here for Cybele's sake.

00:14:55.841 --> 00:14:59.345
She needs me.

00:14:59.345 --> 00:15:00.903
Big Brother?

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:02.943
Big Brother...

00:15:03.115 --> 00:15:04.639
Where are you?

00:15:05.318 --> 00:15:07.377
Cybele...

00:15:08.254 --> 00:15:09.949
Big Brother...

00:15:24.103 --> 00:15:25.738
Who gave the order to go in?!

00:15:25.738 --> 00:15:28.263
Ma'am! We were told
capture was not necessary.

00:15:28.507 --> 00:15:31.010
We were ordered to kill
him by the top brass.

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:33.001
The top brass?!

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.654
Cybele!

00:15:43.956 --> 00:15:45.617
Big Brother!

00:15:48.294 --> 00:15:51.127
How much...

00:15:52.531 --> 00:15:56.331
are you going to make us suffer?!

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.297
Kirchner!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.055
Kirchner!

00:17:10.976 --> 00:17:12.603
Kirchner...

00:17:19.752 --> 00:17:21.310
He disappeared.

00:17:29.962 --> 00:17:31.623
Who are you?

00:17:39.372 --> 00:17:41.073
She's unconscious.

00:17:41.073 --> 00:17:44.343
It's better that way.
She'll be safe here.

00:17:44.343 --> 00:17:46.641
Come on, let's go. They'll find us.

00:17:52.151 --> 00:17:54.244
Ouch, ouch, ouch...

00:17:54.286 --> 00:17:56.722
Alice, are you okay?

00:17:56.722 --> 00:18:00.493
Yes. What was that light just now?

00:18:00.493 --> 00:18:02.825
-Can you stand?
-No way...

00:18:09.769 --> 00:18:11.703
That was...

00:18:12.438 --> 00:18:14.269
Blast it!

00:18:17.109 --> 00:18:21.443
Someone somewhere has stolen
our data and opened the Zone.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.316
You mean that man has
tampered with the Zone?!

00:18:24.316 --> 00:18:25.618
If he hadn't,

00:18:25.618 --> 00:18:28.154
the Enma and Orsel would
never have appeared!

00:18:28.154 --> 00:18:32.147
Did you see? That guy was
controlling the emission of Orsel.

00:18:33.993 --> 00:18:36.757
Just like Tina did.

00:18:37.997 --> 00:18:39.532
Do you think he's dead?

00:18:39.532 --> 00:18:42.334
No, he isn't. He's not dead.

00:18:42.334 --> 00:18:44.427
He has no place to go.

00:18:52.678 --> 00:18:54.270
Dumas!

00:19:02.354 --> 00:19:04.652
You're going to draw a picture for us?

00:19:05.791 --> 00:19:07.349
Of me?

00:19:12.698 --> 00:19:15.468
This is the first time we've ever
posed for a picture, isn't it, honey?

00:19:15.468 --> 00:19:20.132
In that case, we'll have to wear
our nicest clothes, right, honey?

00:19:20.272 --> 00:19:21.296
Yeah...

00:19:21.373 --> 00:19:24.043
Nice clothes, nice clothes, nice clothes...

00:19:24.043 --> 00:19:25.806
Do I have any?

00:19:34.053 --> 00:19:37.853
Come on, honey, don't be so nervous!

00:20:04.884 --> 00:20:07.580
Come on, Amedio! Come here!

00:20:10.089 --> 00:20:11.681
Here...

00:20:12.925 --> 00:20:15.018
He's really shy, isn't he?

00:20:16.562 --> 00:20:18.120
Helga.

00:20:18.664 --> 00:20:20.332
-Come quietly. Quietly.
-Shhh...

00:20:20.332 --> 00:20:22.301
Amedio is here right now.

00:20:22.301 --> 00:20:23.969
Why don't you try feeding him, Helga?

00:20:23.969 --> 00:20:25.493
Okay.

00:20:26.372 --> 00:20:28.897
It's hard at first.

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:43.522
Amedio... W-Why?

00:20:43.522 --> 00:20:45.490
What about our year together?

00:20:49.094 --> 00:20:51.530
Why you little...!

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:54.795
It took a year to get you
to eat from my hand!

00:20:56.702 --> 00:20:59.762
You little brat! Get off her, Amedio!

00:21:00.573 --> 00:21:02.370
Here.

00:21:07.446 --> 00:21:09.676
You little...!

00:21:09.782 --> 00:21:12.751
Huh? Uh, wait, huh?

00:21:13.185 --> 00:21:15.710
Ah! W-Whoa!

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:25.991
Hey! Hold it!

00:21:26.732 --> 00:21:28.700
That's amazing, Helga!

00:21:29.168 --> 00:21:31.500
Hey, Amedio!

00:22:35.567 --> 00:22:45.374
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.644 --> 00:22:55.487
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.487 --> 00:23:00.220
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.259 --> 00:23:05.094
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.497 --> 00:23:14.633
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:19.812
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:19.812 --> 00:23:25.084
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.084 --> 00:23:29.487
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.521 --> 00:23:33.826
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:33.826 --> 00:23:38.695
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
